{"login": "Keshav-Bansal05", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "f4a74f853584d9f9c7f8fd3b8adcee0a214cde2d", "message": "Banker\u2019s Algorithm C++ Code in Operating System", "created_at": "2024-04-01T05:04:46Z", "repo": "Operating-System", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2acb4747ccb56a7d584695453ef7ed4f803980b6", "message": "Round Robin Scheduling Algorithm C++ Code with arrival time -Operating System", "created_at": "2024-04-01T05:03:12Z", "repo": "Operating-System", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bf09f60b5986c9c0c247897b2e3b2ae92c82bfb3", "message": "Priority Preemptive CPU Scheduling Code C++ with arrival time\n\nCode for Priority CPU Scheduling Preemptive in C++. Operating System.\r\nIt has a important feature from all the other codes available on net is that it includes variable arrival time for different process", "created_at": "2024-04-01T05:01:36Z", "repo": "Operating-System", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d8599b07ac4257e912ec721d8aebed1ac96d5f6a", "message": "Program for Priority CPU Scheduling Non Preemptive \n\nCode for Priority CPU Scheduling Non Preemptive in C++. Operating System.\r\nIt has a important feature from all the other codes available on net is that it includes variable arrival time for different process", "created_at": "2024-04-01T04:55:48Z", "repo": "Operating-System", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c5029fc1cbe16bd2bdace97fc03e77f840083538", "message": "Shortest Remaining Time First (SRTF) CPU Scheduling (Preemptive)\n\nYou can input different arrival time for different process. It provides all important outputs like order of process ,their completion time, their waiting time.", "created_at": "2024-04-01T04:50:54Z", "repo": "Operating-System", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fb7432bfee799ae5cae74607bc399e677383b125", "message": "Shortest Job First (SJF) CPU Scheduling (Non-preemptive)\n\nIt includes variable arrival time and provides all the important output like process name , with their arrival time ,completion time waiting time and all others", "created_at": "2024-04-01T04:47:19Z", "repo": "Operating-System", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0654a940820344c4ba13d1e7e8169fa35ad81870", "message": "FCFS CPU Scheduling with arrival time  -Operating System\n\nFirst Come First Serve CPU Process Scheduling with arrival time input in Operating Systems\r\nThis repository hosts C++ code implementing the FCFS scheduling algorithm with arrival time consideration. FCFS is a simple scheduling algorithm where processes are executed based on their arrival order, with the first process arriving being served first. Arrival time is crucial in real-world scenarios where processes may arrive at different times. The code provides a clear implementation of FCFS, ensuring proper sequencing based on arrival time to simulate real-world scenarios effectively.", "created_at": "2024-04-01T04:40:45Z", "repo": "Operating-System", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cc5682fa8f4fc814c7edd239186c33bc31bd69ad", "message": "ui change", "created_at": "2025-05-18T13:37:46Z", "repo": "Keshav-Bansal05", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c0b92b6a8aeedf596c4c57cea39807710110df95", "message": "fixed the ui", "created_at": "2025-05-18T13:28:32Z", "repo": "Keshav-Bansal05", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8b94bf55b5e4532d2295647cb2227ff96211ea6f", "message": "ui", "created_at": "2025-05-18T13:23:44Z", "repo": "Keshav-Bansal05", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "464fc1efb4c7ecab70e60fecc6625db57632af93", "message": "simple uui", "created_at": "2025-05-18T13:17:59Z", "repo": "Keshav-B